AIM: To create a local Git repository and initialize Git.

ALGORITHM
STEP 1: Open a terminal.
STEP 2: Create a folder for the Git practical.
STEP 3: Navigate to the created folder.
STEP 4: Initialize the Git repository using git init.
STEP 5: Check the repository status.
STEP 6: End the terminal.

TERMINAL RUN CODE
mkdir git-practical
cd git-practical
git init
git status
